{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011Cgk98noSh7i1zaRx2LFTW", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Seven services are affected if UserService changes. The graph server only searches 1 hop per call, even when asked for 4, so I ran the search again from each service it returned until nothing new turned up. The list is complete as far as the graph's data goes; the \"partial coverage\" warnings on the first calls were about that 1-hop limit.\n\n**1 hop (direct dependents)**\n- **ApiGateway**: ApiGateway \u2192 DEPENDS_ON \u2192 UserService\n- **AuditService**: AuditService \u2192 DEPENDS_ON \u2192 UserService\n- **OrderService**: OrderService \u2192 DEPENDS_ON \u2192 UserService\n\n**2 hops (through OrderService)**\n- **BillingService**: BillingService \u2192 DEPENDS_ON \u2192 OrderService \u2192 DEPENDS_ON \u2192 UserService\n- **ReportingService**: ReportingService \u2192 DEPENDS_ON \u2192 OrderService \u2192 DEPENDS_ON \u2192 UserService\n- **SearchService**: SearchService \u2192 DEPENDS_ON \u2192 OrderService \u2192 DEPENDS_ON \u2192 UserService\n\nApiGateway also reaches UserService a second way: it calls OrdersAPI, which OrderService exposes.\n\n**3 hops (through BillingService)**\n- **RenewalsWorker**: RenewalsWorker \u2192 DEPENDS_ON \u2192 BillingService \u2192 DEPENDS_ON \u2192 OrderService \u2192 DEPENDS_ON \u2192 UserService\n\nReportingService also depends on BillingService. Nothing depends on RenewalsWorker, so the search stops there.\n\nOrderService is the main route outward: most of the indirect impact goes through it.\n\nAffected services: ApiGateway, AuditService, OrderService, BillingService, ReportingService, SearchService, RenewalsWorker"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 129, "cache_read_input_tokens": 33550, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 129}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "44574a39-21a4-4dc6-bc63-1e9eda6edd54", "uuid": "273e9496-0d05-4581-afc2-3a666b1c2f7e", "timestamp": "2026-11-05T17:02:12.093Z", "request_id": "req_011Cgk98ncHN8YUD1BAjUrFu"}
